<%# An open case, made visible.
    The project rule: where an assignment is missing it is not guessed — the case
    gets a class of its own. This is that class. Every Failure from the readers
    lands here, with its reason and path spelled out.
    The CSS class stays German: it is shared vocabulary with site.css and
    Muster.dc.html. %>
<div class="fehlfall">
  <b><%= title %></b>
  <% if path %> <code><%= path %></code><% end %>
  <br><span class="fehlfall-grund"><%= reason %></span>
</div>
